From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] play video on the hardware decoders

Software decoding in chromium is too slow on the receiver, and drawing
the frames crashes in the GL driver. <video> elements with plain media
URLs, and with them the OIPF A/V objects of the polyfill, are handed to
neutrino instead (control API zapto?hbbtv...), which plays them on its
decoders; the picture appears on the video plane below the page. Not in
the browser process: the GL driver also crashes when one process draws
with it and uses a decoder at once.
---
